---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Welcome to Astro.">
	<h1>Welcome to <span class="text-gradient">Astro</span></h1>
	<p class="instructions">
		To get started, open the directory <code>src/pages</code> in your project.<br />
		<strong>Code Challenge:</strong> Tweak the "Welcome to Astro" message above. Lorem ipsum odor amet, consectetuer adipiscing elit. Porta class aenean aliquam aptent at elit nec consectetur. Scelerisque massa tempus, cubilia condimentum senectus tortor. Platea eros litora lacus porttitor justo. Libero risus ac aliquam libero commodo donec. Mus curabitur congue ante proin sollicitudin? Ullamcorper imperdiet adipiscing magnis ligula nascetur facilisis litora molestie finibus. Maecenas in sapien
		in fusce etiam sem ridiculus mi. Habitant potenti vitae neque cras tempor. Orci commodo semper ridiculus ac donec tempus habitasse maximus. Sed metus et phasellus risus ad auctor porta. Nibh metus urna elit parturient netus purus dictumst. Erat interdum imperdiet, ornare dictumst quisque suspendisse fusce. Nunc integer commodo habitant laoreet interdum maecenas curabitur morbi. Ultricies condimentum varius urna lorem phasellus imperdiet. Risus turpis vivamus nostra potenti; at facilisi hendrerit
		imperdiet. Sapien est phasellus luctus ex imperdiet habitant semper. Quam adipiscing fusce volutpat a faucibus, mi suspendisse fermentum? Enim eget fermentum nec eget efficitur semper. Facilisis convallis commodo tristique leo ipsum dui; velit penatibus nulla. Nascetur convallis dictum netus commodo; enim orci vestibulum. Primis sodales phasellus platea velit semper neque. Nullam per euismod dictum inceptos, dolor efficitur. Hac blandit scelerisque vehicula lectus mus semper viverra nec varius.
		Nisi cras pharetra; magnis vivamus non ultricies.
	</p>
</Layout>

<style>
	h1 {
		font-size: 3rem;
		font-weight: 800;
		margin: 0;
	}
	.text-gradient {
		background-image: var(--accent-gradient);
		-webkit-background-clip: text;
		-webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
		background-size: 400%;
		background-position: 0%;
	}
	.instructions {
		line-height: 1.6;
		margin: 1rem 0;
		border: 1px solid rgba(var(--accent), 25%);
		background-color: white;
		padding: 1rem;
		border-radius: 0.4rem;
	}
	.instructions code {
		font-size: 0.875em;
		font-weight: bold;
		background: rgba(var(--accent), 12%);
		color: rgb(var(--accent));
		border-radius: 4px;
		padding: 0.3em 0.45em;
	}
	.instructions strong {
		color: rgb(var(--accent));
	}
	.link-card-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(24ch, 1fr));
		gap: 1rem;
		padding: 0;
	}
</style>
